---
const improvements = [
  {
    id: 'layouts',
    label: 'Reusable store layouts',
    before: 'Each store was modeled from its audit notes and mechanical drawings.',
    change: 'As recurring store configurations emerged, I built and expanded reusable layout patterns.',
    effect: 'A new store could start from a relevant architectural pattern instead of requiring every part to be redrawn.',
    steps: ['model', 'assemble'],
  },
  {
    id: 'blocks',
    label: 'SolidWorks blocks',
    before: 'Outlets and existing fixtures had to be drawn as individual elements.',
    change: 'Coworkers introduced blocks. I contributed to and improved our library of reusable elements.',
    effect: 'Common details could be placed and adjusted rather than rebuilt individually.',
    steps: ['model', 'assemble'],
  },
  {
    id: 'assemblies',
    label: 'Configurable fixture assemblies',
    before: 'Fixture configurations added repeat modeling work.',
    change: 'I used fixture sub-assemblies that could be reconfigured for different installations.',
    effect: 'Repeated fixture geometry became adaptable components instead of entirely new drawings.',
    steps: ['model', 'assemble'],
  },
  {
    id: 'structure',
    label: 'Model information architecture',
    before: 'The model still needed to accommodate electrical, architecture, and fixture-placement layers.',
    change: 'I organized the SolidWorks information structure for rapid, precise drawing and revision.',
    effect: 'The right layers and reusable geometry were easier to work with as the store model developed.',
    steps: ['model', 'assemble', 'drawings'],
  },
];
---
<section class="workflow" id="workflow-title" aria-labelledby="workflow-heading" data-workflow>
  <div class="workflow-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="uxw-label">Inside the improvement / IDL Worldwide</p>
      <h4 id="workflow-heading">From redrawing each store<br />to working with a reusable system.</h4>
    </div>
    <p>The installation drawings still had to represent real, individually surveyed stores. The production method changed.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="workflow-source">
    <strong>What arrived</strong>
    <p>On-site audits: measurements and notes on soffits, ceilings, electrical points, existing fixtures, placement, and installation areas, alongside store mechanical drawings.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="workflow-comparison" aria-label="Original and improved drawing processes">
    <div class="workflow-lane workflow-lane--before">
      <p class="uxw-label">Before / draw from scratch</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Interpret the audit</strong><span>Translate field notes and store plans</span></li>
        <li data-flow-step="model"><strong>Model the store</strong><span>Draw architecture, electrical, and fixture layers in 3D</span></li>
        <li data-flow-step="drawings"><strong>Produce installation drawings</strong><span>Extract 2D views and mechanical drawing slices</span></li>
        <li><strong>Review and install</strong><span>QC and hand over to the installation team</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="workflow-lane workflow-lane--after">
      <p class="uxw-label">After / build from accumulated knowledge</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Interpret the audit</strong><span>Survey measurements still determine the store-specific work</span></li>
        <li data-flow-step="assemble"><strong>Assemble and adapt</strong><span>Use layout patterns, blocks, fixture sub-assemblies, and model structure</span></li>
        <li data-flow-step="drawings"><strong>Produce installation drawings</strong><span>Make accurate views from a more efficiently organized 3D model</span></li>
        <li><strong>Review and install</strong><span>Request QC promptly, then deliver drawings to installers</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="workflow-discoveries">
    <div class="workflow-discoveries__heading">
      <div>
        <p class="uxw-label">Four interconnected improvements</p>
        <h5>Explore what changed in the middle.</h5>
      </div>
      <p>Select an improvement to see how it affected the production workflow.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="workflow-controls" role="group" aria-label="Inspect drawing workflow improvements" data-workflow-controls hidden>
      {improvements.map((improvement, i) => <button type="button" data-improvement={improvement.id} aria-pressed={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'} aria-controls="workflow-explanation">
        <span aria-hidden="true">0{i + 1}</span><strong>{improvement.label}</strong>
      </button>)}
    </div>
    <div class="workflow-fallback">
      {improvements.map(improvement => <article class="workflow-fallback__item">
        <h6>{improvement.label}</h6>
        <p>{improvement.change} {improvement.effect}</p>
      </article>)}
    </div>
    <div class="workflow-explanation" id="workflow-explanation" aria-live="polite" data-workflow-explanation hidden>
      <p class="uxw-label" data-workflow-category>01 / Reusable store layouts</p>
      <h6 data-workflow-effect>Start from a pattern, then adapt it to the surveyed store.</h6>
      <div class="workflow-explanation__grid">
        <div><span>Original constraint</span><p data-workflow-before></p></div>
        <div><span>Intervention</span><p data-workflow-change></p></div>
        <div><span>Why it mattered</span><p data-workflow-result></p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="workflow-team"><strong>The knowledge was shared.</strong> Coworkers introduced blocks and common pattern libraries. I expanded those ideas, created store layouts, developed my own SolidWorks model structure, and refined my drawing practice. Working together brought the team's turnaround down before I improved my individual workflow further.</p>
  <p class="workflow-method">Process reconstruction based on the designer's firsthand account, not an original historical process diagram. Individual improvement effects were not separately timed.</p>
</section>
<script define:vars={{ improvements }}>
  const root = document.querySelector('[data-workflow]');
  if (root) {
    const controls = root.querySelector('[data-workflow-controls]');
    const explanation = root.querySelector('[data-workflow-explanation]');
    const fallback = root.querySelector('.workflow-fallback');
    const buttons = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll('[data-improvement]'));
    const show = (id) => {
      const data = improvements.find(item => item.id === id);
      if (!data) return;
      buttons.forEach(button => button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(button.dataset.improvement === id)));
      root.querySelector('[data-workflow-category]').textContent = data.label;
      root.querySelector('[data-workflow-effect]').textContent = data.effect;
      root.querySelector('[data-workflow-before]').textContent = data.before;
      root.querySelector('[data-workflow-change]').textContent = data.change;
      root.querySelector('[data-workflow-result]').textContent = data.effect;
      root.querySelectorAll('[data-flow-step]').forEach(step => {
        step.classList.toggle('workflow-step--active', data.steps.includes(step.dataset.flowStep));
      });
    };
    buttons.forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => show(button.dataset.improvement)));
    show(improvements[0].id);
    controls.hidden = false;
    explanation.hidden = false;
    fallback.hidden = true;
  }
</script>
<style>
  .workflow { margin: 34px 0 0; padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 36px); border: 1px solid var(--pv2-line); border-radius: 12px; background: #faf8f2ec; color: var(--pv2-text); }
  .workflow [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .workflow-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 26px; align-items: end; }
  .workflow-heading h4 { font-family: var(--pv2-font-display); font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.65rem); line-height: 1.14; letter-spacing: -.035em; margin: 9px 0 0; }
  .workflow-heading > p { max-width: 29ch; margin: 0 0 4px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--pv2-muted); }
  .workflow-source { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr; gap: 18px; border-block: 1px solid var(--pv2-line); padding: 18px 0; margin: 22px 0; }
  .workflow-source p { margin: 0; max-width: 72ch; }
  .workflow-comparison { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .workflow-lane { border: 1px solid #d8d7d0; border-radius: 9px; padding: 20px; background: #f4f0e8; }
  .workflow-lane--after { background: #edf2e8; border-color: #aec1ac; }
  .workflow-lane > p { margin: 0 0 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #3e4b41; }
  .workflow-lane ol { padding: 0; margin: 0; list-style: none; counter-reset: stages; display: grid; gap: 9px; }
  .workflow-lane li { counter-increment: stages; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 25px minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 10px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 7px; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: background .18s ease, border-color .18s ease; }
  .workflow-lane li::before { content: counter(stages, decimal-leading-zero); font-size: .73rem; font-weight: 700; color: #68756b; grid-row: span 2; padding-top: 3px; }
  .workflow-lane li + li { border-top-color: #d4d5cd; }
  .workflow-lane li strong { font-size: .97rem; line-height: 1.3; }
  .workflow-lane li span { font-size: .83rem; color: #48564c; line-height: 1.45; padding-top: 4px; }
  .workflow-lane li.workflow-step--active { background: #d9e7d4; border-color: #648268; }
  .workflow-lane--before li.workflow-step--active { background: #f0e4db; border-color: #b59a87; }
  .workflow-discoveries { margin-top: 30px; }
  .workflow-discoveries__heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 20px; }
  .workflow-discoveries__heading h5 { font-family: var(--pv2-font-display); font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.2vw, 2rem); margin: 4px 0 0; }
  .workflow-discoveries__heading > p { max-width: 30ch; color: var(--pv2-muted); font-size: .9rem; margin: 0 0 3px; }
  .workflow-controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .workflow-controls button { text-align: left; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; min-height: 92px; padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #c7cfc3; border-radius: 7px; background: #f5f7f0; color: var(--pv2-text); cursor: pointer; font: inherit; }
  .workflow-controls button span { font-size: .75rem; color: var(--pv2-muted); }
  .workflow-controls button strong { font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.3; }
  .workflow-controls button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: #dce9d7; border-color: #405b44; box-shadow: inset 0 -3px #405b44; }
  .workflow-controls button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--pv2-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .workflow-explanation { margin-top: 12px; padding: 22px; border-radius: 7px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #cad6c8; }
  .workflow-explanation h6 { font-family: var(--pv2-font-display); font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.8vw, 1.55rem); margin: 8px 0 18px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .workflow-explanation__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .workflow-explanation__grid > div + div { border-left: 1px solid #d8ded4; padding-left: 18px; }
  .workflow-explanation__grid span { display: block; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .07em; color: #526b55; }
  .workflow-explanation__grid p { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: .94rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .workflow-fallback { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .workflow-fallback__item { padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #cad6c8; border-radius: 6px; }
  .workflow-fallback h6 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .workflow-fallback p { margin: 0; }
  .workflow-team { padding: 18px 20px; background: #e7ede3; border-radius: 7px; margin: 22px 0 0; line-height: 1.6; }
  .workflow-method { color: var(--pv2-muted); margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: .79rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  @media (max-width: 850px) { .workflow-controls { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } .workflow-heading, .workflow-discoveries__heading { display: block; } .workflow-heading > p, .workflow-discoveries__heading > p { margin-top: 12px; max-width: 70ch; } }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .workflow-source { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 5px; } .workflow-comparison, .workflow-explanation__grid, .workflow-fallback { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .workflow-lane { padding: 14px; } .workflow-explanation { padding: 16px; } .workflow-explanation__grid > div + div { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid #d8ded4; padding: 13px 0 0; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .workflow-lane li { transition: none; } }
</style>
